	(text "WAIT-STATE REGISTER  $FFF5  (write-only, cleared by RESB) - logic in U84 (GAL D)\n  bits 1:0  banked RAM  $8000-$9FFF     waits = 3 - value\n  bits 3:2  banked ROM  $A000-$DFFF     waits = 3 - value\n  bits 5:4  I/O $FF20-$FFFF              waits = 3 - value\nReset leaves 3 waits everywhere. Main RAM, OS ROM and the VIA/ACIA never get waits.\nU84 drives CPU_RDY low only while stalling (R4 pulls it up; WAI still works).\nD1 lets a slot card pulling bus RDY low stall the CPU; the CPU's WAI is not seen on bus RDY.\nU87 (GAL G): OS ROM bank lines W = RW for $E000-$EFFF, 0 for $F000-$FFFF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
